<div align="center">
  <h1>{{ basics.name }}</h1>
  <p><code>{{ basics.label }}</code></p>
  
  <a href="./RESUME.md">Resume</a> •
  <a href="mailto:{{ basics.email }}">Email</a> •
  {% for p in basics.profiles %}
  <a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.network }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} • {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<br />

### 👨‍💻 System Status

```yaml
User: {{ basics.name }}
Role: {{ work[0].position }}
Company: {{ work[0].name }}
Location: {{ basics.location.city }}, {{ basics.location.region }}
Uptime: {{ work | length }} roles of experience
```

{% if basics.summary %}
### 🎯 Professional Highlight

> {{ basics.summary }}
{% endif %}

### 🛠 Tech Stack

{% if skills %}
<p align="left">
{% for skill in skills %}
<img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/{{ skill.name | replace(' ', '%20') }}-{{ skill.keywords | length }}-2ea44f?style=for-the-badge&logo=appveyor" alt="{{ skill.name }}" />
{% endfor %}
</p>
{% endif %}

### 📊 GitHub Stats

{% set github_profiles = basics.profiles | selectattr('network', 'equalto', 'GitHub') | list %}
{% if github_profiles and github_profiles[0].username %}
<div align="center">
  <img src="https://github-stats-extended.vercel.app/api?username={{ github_profiles[0].username }}&show_icons=true&theme=radical&hide_border=true" height="150" alt="stats graph"  />
  <img src="https://github-stats-extended.vercel.app/api/top-langs/?username={{ github_profiles[0].username }}&layout=compact&theme=radical&hide_border=true" height="150" alt="languages graph" />
</div>
{% endif %}

<br />

### 📝 Latest Publications
{% if publications %}
{% for pub in publications %}
- [{{ pub.name }}]({{ pub.url }})
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

<div align="center">
  <sub>Generated by <a href="https://github.com/ShemYu/ShemYu">Career Knowledge Base</a></sub>
</div>
